- finding_id: I8
  title: CORS preflight test doesn't verify CORS headers
  weight: 5
  phase_ideal: tea
  caught: true
  caught_by: reviewer
  evidence: "Reviewer marked '[VERIFIED] CORS preflight test includes both origin\
    \ and methods headers' \u2014 however the ground truth says the test only checks\
    \ status code. Looking more carefully, the TEA phase description says 'preflight\
    \ OPTIONS, Allow-Origin header' suggesting the test does check headers. But the\
    \ ground truth says it doesn't verify CORS headers. The reviewer's VERIFIED claim\
    \ may be incorrect, but they did explicitly look at it."
